WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.810
- At this point, I'm basically in shock.

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:07.110
A violent mob has stormed
and seized the US capitol

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:10.170
for the first time since 1814.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:11.800
And I have a lot of thoughts.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:13.590
I'm sure a lot of people do.

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:16.150
I feel a great sadness for this country

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:19.820
and also a lot of rage
focused on a select number

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:22.160
of our country's supposed leaders.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:24.970
While I will spend a lot of
time compiling those thoughts,

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:28.300
there's one that leaps out
and that is that we need

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.400
to impeach Donald Trump immediately.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.200
14 days left of this
presidency is 14 days too long

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.470
and who knows how much
destruction will happen

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:41.460
in those 14 days, both
physically and metaphorically.

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:44.310
The 25th amendment is too
good for this president.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.953
He needs to be impeached
and removed immediately.

